! ieee37_paper_reconstruction.dss
!
! IEEE 37-node feeder per project spec sections 16-17, built directly on top
! of the official topology/line/load data in this same directory
! (ieee37_official.dss + IEEELineCodes_official.dss). This file is the
! OpenDSS-side twin of experiments/exp03_37bus.py's build_37bus_system() --
! every reconstruction assumption documented in that module's docstring
! applies identically here. Do not edit one without re-checking the other.
!
! Unlike ieee13_paper_reconstruction.dss, almost nothing changes from the
! official file: both transformers are already Delta-Delta (matching the
! paper's description), and bus 775 already has no load. The only
! differences from the official file are:
!   1. Voltage regulators (reg1a/reg1c) and the near-zero-impedance Jumper
!      line are omitted; bus 799r is replaced by 799 throughout (ideal-merge
!      simplification, matching exp03_37bus.py assumption C).
!   2. XFM1's Xhl is left at the official 1.81% by default here (matching
!      build_37bus_system()'s default) -- see project spec section 17's
!      flagged discrepancy with the paper's literal X~0.00181 pu reading.

Clear
Set DefaultBaseFrequency=60

new circuit.IEEE37_Paper_Reconstruction
~ basekv=230 pu=1.00 phases=3 bus1=SourceBus
~ MVAsc3=200000 MVAsc1=210000

New Transformer.SubXF Phases=3 Windings=2 Xhl=8
~ wdg=1 bus=SourceBus conn=Delta kv=230  kva=2500  %r=1
~ wdg=2 bus=799       conn=Delta kv=4.8  kva=2500  %r=1

New Transformer.XFM1 Phases=3 Windings=2 Xhl=1.81
~ wdg=1 bus=709 conn=Delta kv=4.80  kva=500  %r=0.045
~ wdg=2 bus=775 conn=Delta kv=0.48  kva=500  %r=0.045

Redirect IEEELineCodes_official.dss

New Line.L1  Phases=3 Bus1=701.1.2.3 Bus2=702.1.2.3 LineCode=722 Length=0.96
New Line.L2  Phases=3 Bus1=702.1.2.3 Bus2=705.1.2.3 LineCode=724 Length=0.4
